{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_st03","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_st03","title":"剜刺","storyCode":"IS-ST-3","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"9fad5f4ae55eaf00ca2b0cb1de45881380edbb455729fe74b7c5e3aabb5e8e2d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"這一天的清晨，一聲清脆的銃聲，透過廣播，傳遍了整座沃爾西尼城。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，真的是法官閣下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是盧比奧閣下的女兒，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......我還以為，父親跟我說您會來照看我是在開玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我朋友都特別崇拜您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我父親那樣的人一比，您簡直就是政府裡唯一的清流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你和盧比奧先生關係不好嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......談不上好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是挺喜歡父親的，因為他時間總是很多，經常陪我玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，現在我也覺得，父親這樣只知道所謂明哲保身的人，實在是太沒有志氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經和他一起從基層做起的同僚，現在都飛黃騰達了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有他到了這個歲數才混了一個邊緣的職位，而且一點上進心都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他曾經的同僚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，前陣子死掉的那個建設部部長卡拉奇就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是個危險的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......但是，我天天都能在電視上看到那個人，而且大家族的人都會對他有所禮讓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不覺得，如果要當官的話，就得做到那種地步才有意義嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，父親這次忽然接任了建設部部長的位置，我其實是很驚訝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道他怎麼就忽然開竅了......要是他早點這麼做，母親也不會和他離婚了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離婚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，母親也覺得父親太窩囊了，所以前幾年和他離婚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我母親性格也不太好，所以我最後還是選擇了跟著父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，法官閣下，您一定知道父親是怎麼被選為建設部部長的吧，跟我說說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您在房間裡隨便坐坐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，我也不打算出去，就打算聽一聽父親的就職演講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（盧比奧部長的房間......比想像中的整潔。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很奇怪吧，父親看起來是個邋遢的人，其實生活很規律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，他還有寫日記的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"日記？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我記得，對了，就擺在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是日記，其實我看他是想到了才會寫一點上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年斷斷續續加起來也就寫了這麼一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便看沒關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，父親放在這裡，就是不介意別人看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看過幾次，上面寫的都是些無聊的東西，要我說呀，就是一本活脫脫的中年男人生活實錄，枯燥又冗長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要是有興趣，儘管看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧先生，這裡就是您發表演講的地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都出去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......我們接到的命令是保護您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人進得來，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，權力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用沙發把門堵住......能做的也就只有這麼多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇，再等我一會，馬上我就來陪你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......醫生說，對方下手的位置恰好偏離了心臟幾釐米，所以沒有立刻致死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是情況還是很不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從昨天回來開始就一副失魂落魄的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐在那裡，一動不動，讓她吃飯也沒有反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......讓她好好想一想吧，我和可頌繼續在醫院守著，她就交給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，你們在醫院也注意安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，好無聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我記得今天好像有什麼演講？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽聽看好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位親愛的市民朋友們，你們好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想必你們之中的大部分對我並不瞭解，這不奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我在過去擔任了食品安全部部長這樣一個並不重要的職位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，我想，大部分市民朋友，除了前任部長卡拉奇以及我們的拉維妮婭法官，恐怕對我們的政府知之甚少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我與法官閣下並不熟，但是，我與卡拉奇前部長，倒是有些交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，今天的演講，就從這位大家都熟知的人開始講起吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我與卡拉奇是同期進入市場監管局的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他身強力壯，精力充沛，負責實地考察，而我則在後方進行一些文書工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他在當時就以敢說敢做而聞名系統內，連大家族他都敢惹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說實在的，他也算是命硬，有好幾次差點就被對他不滿的家族給除掉了，要嘛被他躲了過去，要嘛被他扛了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總之，當時，局裡都把他當做一個刺頭，沒人想幫他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"於是，給他上報工作的任務，就丟給了同樣不受待見的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"給他上報工作，可是費了我好大的功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，做這項工作又給了我一些成就感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我沒有辦法像他那樣直接，但是他替我做了我想做的事，我能在這方面幫襯他，也算是一種回報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一來二去的，我們也算是熟絡了起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂，你這兩年也在卡拉奇身邊做事，我知道你對他評價很高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所知道的他，是什麼樣的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他是一個很有活力的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他知道如何應付家族，而且他並不是單純地圓滑，他知道如何在巧妙地讓家族得到好處的同時，讓他們為他的目的服務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許多事情原本會受到諸多來自不同家族的阻礙，到了他手上，總是能被一一辦妥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出來，你的行事手段，受到了他不小影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是覺得，他的做法和我的想法有相似的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在已經不再是打打殺殺能夠解決問題的時代了，父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族如果想要順應時代，應當做出相應的改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂，你還是不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你下意識地把自己和拉維妮婭還有卡拉奇放在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但永遠不要忘記，你和他們不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的知道，你就不會站在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，已經沒有時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂，如果你能活下來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，他雖然是許多家族的眼中釘，但能力之強，也是大家有目共睹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"於是，他還是遠早在我之前得到了晉升。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，我當時以為，他晉升後會死得很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為我始終覺得，他之前是在一個不觸及太多利益的地方，所以沒招致真正的殺身之禍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是隨著他的地位上升，他如果還是那副樣子，那一定會惹到惹不起的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我錯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我從來都不知道，父親原來是這麼健談的一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您覺得呢，法官閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官閣下？"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧比奧的女兒發現，拉維妮婭完全沒有注意到她的呼喚。\n她全神貫注地投入在了閱讀手中的日記上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧，你究竟......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，在我們的系統裡，並不乏與卡拉奇擁有相同初衷的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，因為各種各樣的原因，他們在最後選擇了向家族屈服，甚至諂媚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但卡拉奇不同，他不僅沒有屈服，反而時刻在尋找著與他們對抗的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而他的努力是有價值的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他不僅沒有如我所想地輕易死去，反而越爬越高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而當我們在某個宴會上重逢時，他對我說了一句我至今記憶猶新的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“如今的家族是軟弱的。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個大叔膽子還挺大的嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......德克薩斯，外面好像有點狀況，我去確認一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，如果我們把喬萬娜帶回龍門，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得她是個很有趣的人欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——我也覺得，你不是這麼想的哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克薩斯將視線轉向窗邊的桌子，那裡擺放著一條項鍊。\n那是西西里夫人的信物。\n喬萬娜為她留下的禮物。\n在爺爺眼中，哥倫比亞的家族們是變味了的。\n他們為了利益，可以染指那些毫無底線的產業，可以去進行沒有道義可言的謀殺。\n在父親眼中，敘拉古的家族們是腐朽的。\n放著唾手可得的利益不去爭取，僅僅是為了所謂的道義限制自己的腳步，只能被稱為愚蠢。\n而在德克薩斯看來，爺爺和父親都是正確的，又都是錯誤的。\n如果，如果她只是憤怒於喬萬娜的遭遇。\n那她可以像七年前那樣離開，只是這一次，她會帶上喬萬娜。\n但是，當她得知爺爺的死訊時，當她對那名洗車工視而不見時，當她對父親求助的命令視而不見時，她心中想的是——\n這一切似乎沒有盡頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他向我展示了他應付家族成員的方法，他的手段簡單到令人發笑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他給出了他們無法拒絕的貨物，以及利益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"家族們並非不能強佔他所擁有的管道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然而，一個優秀的管理者是他們所缺少的，他們只知掠奪，卻從來不知道何為真正的管理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他憑藉著自身出色的能力，一步一步成了幾大家族之間的紅人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"並在大家族們因為建設部部長的位置大打出手時，成了那個讓所有人都滿意的人選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說到這裡，我想會有人提出疑問——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣聽來，卡拉奇似乎和那些左右逢源的人並無區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我想說的是，在敘拉古這樣一個國家，在這樣一個以惡為基底的國家之中，從一開始，就不可能存在一個好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"偏激一些地說，我們都是邪惡的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這些話，是應該在就職演講上說的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，果然應該趁早轉移一下陣地的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過昨天發生了那樣的事，也沒有辦法就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，好厲害的薩科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只有一個人，圍住她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的好搭檔現在正在休息，你們能不能安靜一點？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是些喜歡擾民的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，這種時候其他人在，一定會說，“能天使，你也很擾民！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人好沒勁哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來，這裡有需要幫助的傢伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前就有些好奇了，你這傢伙，難道說......很閒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是和你一樣，都在等待一個答案罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯回不回龍門對你來說很重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，現在的話，我希望她回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......那也就是說，你是站在我這邊的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正確。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，多一個人總比只有我自己好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉抱歉，說了一些掃興的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，大家應當也發現了，今天，我坐在這裡，並不是來發表就職演講的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是來說一些心裡話的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇這樣一個心懷抱負的人，卻從來沒有向我表達過他對於新城市的展望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是因為，當他坐上這個位置時，他就已經做好了赴死的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他在這兩年裡做的事大家是有目共睹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在我以為他能撐到新城市建立時，他卻在前幾天那麼突然地死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我，終究是咽不下這口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我接近了貝洛內家族，向他們自薦，獲得了這個位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我也在這個過程中，瞭解到了貝洛內家族與薩盧佐家族的驚天密謀——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們從一開始就計劃著攪亂城內的局勢，並圖謀著奪取新建造的移動城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後，以此來對抗西西里夫人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，這——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多有沒有反應？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忠誠的家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......貝納爾多這個老東西，到底在想什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹布朗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹布朗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在盧比奧附近吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去解決這個瘋癲的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......我猜也攔不住真想進來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真蠢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做這種事又有什麼意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的打扮，你平時是工人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我平時在一家洗車店工作，叫“丹布朗洗車店”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我好像有印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你叫丹布朗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對自己的這份工作有什麼感想嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古變得越來越溫吞了，我無事可做，才給自己找了點事做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊，你應該多看一看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些高高在上的家族成員啊，以為能夠永遠支配我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們以為，你們的敵人永遠只有彼此，而對我們不屑一顧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，時代是在前進的，沒有什麼是一成不變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你說得再好聽，你所做的也不過是說了幾句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾句話就能推翻家族，推翻西西里夫人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在這個千載難逢的機會中，我的想法已經傳達了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多和西西里夫人誰會贏，我不知道，我也沒有興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所相信的是——時代終將會拋棄你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古如果註定迎來新的時代，那其中的主角，必定不是名為家族的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有力量，我們確實弱小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，所謂的文明，本就是為了克服暴力而存在的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們追求著一種平等，一種不建立在暴力之上的秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暴力才是我們的本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？那麼，為什麼所有家族都在向著同一個方向前進？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼他們都在追求著金錢與權力，而非暴力與鬥爭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如，今天在這裡殺了我，難道只是一種暴力的宣洩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道不是因為——我妨礙了你背後的人獲取權力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你知道答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並且，如果你不介意的話，我希望由我自己來了結自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道這是什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，幾年前透過一些管道，從黑鋼買來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銃不僅使用困難，而且對於好勇鬥狠的家族成員來說，這東西也不一定能解決他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最多不過是用來防備和自己一樣弱小的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在看來，我早幾年就已經想好了，用它來指著誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧比奧緩緩將銃口對準自己的太陽穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，丹布朗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願有一天，你能在敘拉古的土地上，只作為一名洗車工存在，而不必拿起武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐，我在做夢嗎？父親，他......居然會那樣和一個殺手說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧之女","speakerId":"avg_npc_700_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，父親......他有危險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉維妮婭感到眼淚濕潤了自己的眼眶。\n但她來不及抹掉，因為她心中已經有所預感。\n她走到盧比奧女兒的身邊，輕輕捂住了她的耳朵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i14"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃爾西尼的居民永遠不會忘記這一天。\n這一天的清晨，一聲清脆的銃聲，通過廣播，傳遍了整座沃爾西尼城。\n前沃爾西尼食品安全部部長，盧比奧，在接任建設部部長的就職演講中身亡。\n隨後發生的諸多混亂，雖然僅在半日內就得到了控制，卻成了改變敘拉古未來的開端。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
